# Code map (frontend)

| Feature | Files / hints |
|---------|----------------|
| Price tags, jewelry cards, sales signs | `script.js` ~`buildPriceTagCellHTML`, `index.html` price tag modal; `styles.css` `.price-tag` |
| Tabs / cards UI | `switchTab`, `*Cards` loaders in `script.js`; `index.html` tab buttons `data-tab` |
| Save / load | `loadDataFromAPI`, `saveDataToAPI` → `/api/snapshot` |
| Shop reports | `getShopReportCommissionPercent`, monthly shop statement section in `script.js` |
| Auth overlay | `server.js` session + login modal in `index.html` |

`script.js` is large (~19k lines). Grep for the **function name** above instead of `glob **/*`.